@UserService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5231

### Svi korisnici
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user
Accept: application/json

### Pretraga i filter
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user?search=admin&role=Admin&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

### Korisnik po ID-u
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Korisnik po korisnickom imenu
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/username/admin
Accept: application/json

### Audit log korisnika
GET {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/audit
Accept: application/json

### Registracija novog korisnika
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Testic",
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "contactInfo": "+381601112223",
  "password": "test123456"
}

### Validacija kredencijala (koristi AuthService)
POST {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/credentials/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Azuriranje profila
PUT {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marko Clan Izmenjen",
  "email": "member@example.com",
  "contactInfo": "+381600000099"
}

### Deaktivacija korisnika (Admin)
PATCH {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/deactivate?performedBy=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Aktivacija korisnika (Admin)
PATCH {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333/activate?performedBy=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Promena uloge (Admin)
PATCH {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "newRole": "ProjectManager",
  "changedBy": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### Brisanje korisnika (Admin)
DELETE {{UserService_HostAddress}}/api/user/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
